The '''Zygerrian system'''<ref name="Falcon 91" />, also known as the '''Zygerria system''',<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}}</ref> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]], within the [[Chorlian sector]]. It contained the [[planet]] [[Zygerria]], [[homeworld]] of the [[Zygerrian]] [[species]]. The system was situated on two minor [[Hyperspace route|trade routes]].<ref name="Falcon 91" />

